<title>MALTA: Yield rate unchanged in Malta bills.</title>
<headline>Yield rate unchanged in Malta bills.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta Treasury will issue on Friday Lm 8.8 million ($23.7 million) in 28-day Treasury bills maturing on January 24, 1997.</p>
<p>The bills will have a yield rate of 4.9 percent per year, unchanged from the previous 28-day issues of December 13.</p>
<p>The Treasury will also issue Lm 3.0 million in 91-day percent unchanged from the previous issue of December 20.</p>
</text>
